Founder-approved one-time release trigger: deploy the exact main commit containing the merged and tested ATLAS demand observability, persistent source circuit breaker, verified-source counting gate, and stale-offer guard. The existing production-deploy workflow must pass its full test job before deploying and must verify /health git_sha equals GITHUB_SHA. The approved circuit policy remains three consecutive transient failures, a 15-minute initial cooldown with exponential increase to 6 hours, Retry-After handling for HTTP 429, and actionable AUTH_REQUIRED for 401/403. No schema or direct D1 data write is part of this trigger.
